WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.350
- Robert Durst, the millionaire

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.260
who was the subject of
the documentary "The Jinx"

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.410
was found guilty of murder, finally.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.610
A California jury found Durst guilty

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.210
of the murder of Susan Berman,

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.230
who was going to tell the police

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:16.550
how she helped Durst cover
up a different murder.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.770
She was shot in the back of the head

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.320
before she could testify.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.289
And Robert Durst was found
guilty of that murder

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:22.662
and believe it or not,

00:00:22.662 --> 00:00:25.490
the tapes from "The Jinx"
played a crucial role

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.710
in convicting Durst.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.430
After filmmaker Andrew Jarecki

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.905
turned those tapes over to the LAPD,

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:33.552
they issued an arrest warrant
and arrested Durst in 2015

00:00:33.552 --> 00:00:35.650
and he has now been found guilty.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.530
You might recall that Durst was
acquitted of the 2001 murder

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.410
of Morris Black, his neighbor,

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:43.570
though Durst admitted
to dismembering the body

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.880
and disposing of it.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.990
Durst will serve a mandatory
life sentence in prison

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.473
and he's not going to
get out anytime soon.

